-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A NOTE ON THE CUT-OFF VALUES, WHICH THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above applies to the CODE in this repository: the Stata
commands, the build and validation scripts, the demonstration and the
documentation.

It does NOT apply to the 616 cut-off values in functions/dta/eiod_cutoffs.csv
and eiod_cutoffs.dta. Those are transcribed from Tables 3 and 4a-4g of:

    Intake - Center for Dietary Assessment (2026).
    Methods for Assessing Healthy, Environmentally Sustainable Diets Globally.
    https://www.intake.org/sites/default/files/2026-01/Intake-EIOD-Methods-Paper-Jan2026-Final.pdf

They are reproduced here so that the metrics can be applied without re-typing
them, with Intake credited as the source. Any rights in those values rest with
Intake, not with the author of this package.

Whether any licence condition attaches to redistributing them is an open
question that has been put to Intake and is not yet answered. If Intake asks for
a change in how they are distributed, it will be made.
